              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon. May have a shield (+2 pts), light armour (+2), compound bow (+2), horse (free, M8). As uprisings gained momentum they tended to attract nobles and other powerful leaders. (The Art of War p.113)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
