              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Two crewmen with hand weapons, one armed with a spear tipped halberd and one armed with a crossbow, riding in a four-horse heavy chariot with driver. Crew may have light armour (+2 pts each). Heavy Chariots cause D3 Strength 4 Impact Hits. Crossbows used from chariots may only fire once. (The Art of War p.113)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
