              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon. May have swords and shields or spear tipped halberd (+1 pt) or bows (+2 pts) or crossbows (+3 pts), may have light armour (+2 pts). (The Art of War p.114)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
