            <profile id="9080-9a25-4828-7804" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special character. Armed with a hand weapon, heavy halberd and lamellar armour and horse (free, M8). Army General. Charisma. Warrior of Legend. Frenzy. Invulnerable to Weapons. Healing Potions: ignores one wound caused on any unit he is included with per turn. 0-1; replaces the Celestial Master as Army General. (The Art of War p.115)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="afb6-3b7c-befc-fec7" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">None</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
