  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="0e3b-5eb5-3875-0a77" name="Han Dynasty: Yellow Scarves Religious Cultists (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>YELLOW SCARVES RELIGIOUS CULTISTS (The Art of War, pp.112-115). Special rules: Charisma (a character with this ability provides his Leadership as Army General until he or his unit flees or breaks; then a Panic test as for the death of the General), Sacred Chant (at the start of his turn the player may announce a Sacred Chant: all units become immune to Panic tests and each model gains one additional attack for that one turn; once only), Invulnerable to Weapons (units or characters may re-roll any Panic tests and are subject to the Stubborn rules). Rousing the Mob: at the start of the first turn the mob takes a Leadership test; if passed subtract the dice roll from its Leadership: 0-3 the Mob moves forward at least 4" and is subject to all Warband Psychology rules, 4-8 the same plus doubled attacks in the first round of all combats; if failed the mob counts as Levies. Fear of horses: a Mob successfully charged by cavalry, chariots, elephants, camels, war wagons etc. must take a Fear test. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Yellow Scarves Religious Cultists]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Mobs: at least 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  HAN DYNASTY - RELIGIOUS CULTISTS - YELLOW SCARVES. Characters up to 25%. Infantry at least 25%. Mobs at least 25%. Special Units up to 25% (only one selected option per 1,000 points).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
